  "arcade_evidence": "At a test height of 1.15 m, independent west/east casts through the hall pass both walls of the vestibule. The first blocking geometry is at the far teaching-wing return. The 2022 district account confirms east and west corridors, with classrooms along both sides. Only the western arch profile can be traced sufficiently in the 2017 picture. Mirroring the opposite profile is a modeling assumption; detail beyond these doorways and the auditorium interior is outside the surveyed model."
